# Announcement drafts and their screenshots, kept locally.
announcement/

# Built installers, each version in a folder of its own (release/README.md). The APKs and
# the README on publishing them are committed. The desktop installers (around 100 MB each,
# past GitHub's file limit) only go on the GitHub release; anything else isn't kept either.
release/**
!release/*/
!release/README.md
!release/*/*.apk

